title: "Minimal Brick Ontology (MBO): an OWL ontology and SKOS thesaurus for building bricks"
abstract: >-
  A small OWL ontology aligned to CIDOC CRM, CRMba and CRMdig, with a SKOS thesaurus of
  colours, part designs, features and units, SHACL shapes, a DCAT-AP catalogue and a
  click-through documentation site.
type: software
